    "html": "<span class=\"kicker\">Act 1: Concepts &amp; Phases &middot; End-to-End Pipeline</span>\n  <h2>Seven Phases, All Accounted For</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\">Resolving the historic whiteboard anomaly: the original scans skipped Stage 4. Act 1 establishes <b>Phase 4: Review &amp; Verification</b>, ensuring human gating and adversarial compliance audits before code merges.</p>\n  <div class=\"body scroll\">\n    <div class=\"cols\" style=\"margin-bottom:1em\">\n      \n      <div>\n        <table style=\"font-size:.8em\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>Phase</th><th>Mission &amp; Focus</th><th>Oversight &amp; Gate</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><b>1. Specify</b></td><td>Intent intake, legacy C# code archaeology, formal PRD (A)</td><td><span class=\"pill gate\">Gate: PRD GO / NO-GO</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>2. Dispatch</b></td><td>Task decomposition, autonomy rungs, sandbox isolation (C)</td><td><span class=\"pill int\">Rung &amp; Budget Matching</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>3. Generate</b></td><td>Service AST skeletons, parallel microservice codegen (D)</td><td><span class=\"pill led\">Isolated Sandbox Build</span></td></tr>\n            <tr style=\"background:#FFF9E6\"><td><b>4. Review \u26a1</b></td><td><b>Adversarial challenge, compliance audit, peer review</b></td><td><span class=\"pill gap\">Resolved Anomaly \u00b7 Gatekeeper</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>5. Validate</b></td><td>Isolated TDD execution (E), load tests, balance invariants</td><td><span class=\"pill gcp\">Automated Assertion Run</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>6. Shadow</b></td><td>Dual ingestion, live traffic mirroring, $0.00 drift proof</td><td><span class=\"pill gate\">Gate: Shadow Cutover</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>7. Update</b></td><td>Documentation harvesting, calibration ledger, closure loop</td><td><span class=\"pill good\">Closes Loop \u21ba into Phase 1</span></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:.8em\">\n          <h3>Why Phase 4 Was Missing</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size:.84em\">On the whiteboard, the team numbered stages 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7. In a manual workflow, code review is an afterthought. In an autonomous software factory, <b>Phase 4 is a mandatory constitutional firewall</b> where independent security, compliance, and regulatory personas challenge the generated code before it touches integration environments.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"callout\">\n          <b>Closed Loop Learning:</b> Phase 7 updates the Calibration Ledger (<code>calibrations.yaml</code>). Lessons learned from shadow gating are automatically fed back into Phase 1 golden PRD templates, preventing prompt drift and organizational amnesia.\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"openExplorerSection('pipeline')\" style=\"font-size:.82em;padding:.4em .8em\">\n          \ud83d\udd04 Inspect Interactive Phases in Explorer &rarr;\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>"
