    "html": "<span class=\"kicker\">Act 1: Concepts &amp; Phases &middot; Data Contracts</span>\n  <h2>From Informal Files to 10 Strongly-Typed Artifacts</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\">Upgrading handwritten whiteboard notes into 10 machine-enforced JSON Schema contracts with bidirectional entity relationships, cryptographic hashes, and immutable audit trails.</p>\n  <div class=\"body scroll\">\n    <div class=\"cols\" style=\"margin-bottom:1em\">\n      \n      <div>\n        <table style=\"font-size:.78em\">\n          <thead><tr><th>Artifact</th><th>Contract Type</th><th>Schema Role</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><b>Artifact A</b></td><td><span class=\"pill ext\">Golden PRD</span></td><td>Structured intent, NFR bounds &amp; statutory rules</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>Artifact B</b></td><td><span class=\"pill led\">Negotiation File</span></td><td>Disagreement ledger, trade-offs &amp; consensus</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>Artifact C</b></td><td><span class=\"pill int\">Topology Contract</span></td><td>Task decomposition, autonomy rungs &amp; mocks</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>Artifact D</b></td><td><span class=\"pill gcp\">Build Report</span></td><td>Service AST skeletons, source &amp; manifests</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>Artifact E</b></td><td><span class=\"pill good\">Test Suite</span></td><td>Zero-code-access spec-derived assertions</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>Artifact F</b></td><td><span class=\"pill gate\">Evidence Pack</span></td><td>Immutable compliance &amp; bank regulator proof</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>Registry</b></td><td><span class=\"pill int\">Capabilities</span></td><td>Agent skills, versions &amp; performance ratings</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>Ledger</b></td><td><span class=\"pill led\">Calibrations</span></td><td>Living SOP adjustments &amp; prompt calibrations</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card good\" style=\"margin-bottom:.8em\">\n          <h3>\"Disagreement is an Artifact\" (Artifact B)</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size:.84em\">The whiteboard introduced the \"Negotiation File.\" We elevated it to a first-class engineering contract. When an agent challenges another agent or a human engineer disputes a specification, <b>the disagreement is recorded as an immutable signed artifact</b>, creating a transparent audit trail of design trade-offs for bank examiners.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"callout\">\n          <b>Bidirectional Traceability:</b> Every line of generated Go/C# code in Artifact D links back to an acceptance criterion in Artifact A, a test in Artifact E, and a compliance hash in Artifact F.\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"openExplorerSection('artifacts')\" style=\"font-size:.82em;padding:.4em .8em\">\n          \ud83d\udce6 View Interactive DER Data Model &rarr;\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>"
