    "html": "<span class=\"kicker\">Act 1: Concepts &amp; Phases &middot; Constitutional Governance</span>\n  <h2>Constitutional Separation of Powers &amp; 28 Personas</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\">Eliminating circular confirmation bias: <b>\"Author and judge are never the same persona.\"</b> The factory defines 28 specialized personas across 6 families equipped with 111 machine-executable skills.</p>\n  <div class=\"body scroll\">\n    <div class=\"cols\" style=\"margin-bottom:1em\">\n      \n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:.8em\">\n          <h3>The Test Isolation Doctrine</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size:.84em\">When human SWEs write tests, they write tests to prove their code works. In the Zip Agentic Factory, the <b>Test Author persona operates in complete isolation from the implementation code</b>. It derives test suites strictly from Artifact A (PRD) and API schemas. If implementation code passes tests written by an agent that never saw the code, circular hallucination drops to zero.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card good\">\n          <h3>Adversarial Personas (Red Team)</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size:.84em\">Every generative persona is paired with an independent adversary: <i>Requirements Architect vs. Spec Adversary</i>, <i>Code Implementer vs. Static Analyzer</i>, <i>Service Engineer vs. Chaos Engineer</i>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <table style=\"font-size:.78em\">\n          <thead><tr><th>Family</th><th>Role</th><th>Key Personas (28 Total)</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><b>A: Product</b></td><td>Intent Intake</td><td>PM, Domain SMEs, Regulatory Analyst, UX Designer</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>B: Architecture</b></td><td>Topology &amp; Specs</td><td>Reqs Architect, Spec Adversary, Enterprise Arch</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>C: Build</b></td><td>Codegen</td><td>Service SWE, Scaffold Agent, Backfill Specialist</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>D: Judges</b></td><td>Quality &amp; Safety</td><td>Isolated Test SWE, Static Analyzer, Red Team</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>E: DevOps</b></td><td>Substrate</td><td>GKE Substrate Eng, CI/CD Specialist, SRE Agent</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><b>F: Governance</b></td><td>Compliance</td><td>CISO Compliance Officer, Token Economist</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:.8em;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:.8em;color:var(--muted)\">10 MVP personas selected for Phase 1 dry run.</span>\n          <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"openExplorerSection('personas')\" style=\"font-size:.8em;padding:.4em .8em\">\n            \ud83d\udc65 Open 28-Persona Directory &rarr;\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>"
