    "isTitleSlide": false,
    "notes": "<b>Key executive verdict:</b> 8 weeks is technically possible but leaves Zip with an orphaned platform. Scenario 3 trains Quantium and Zip engineers to run it permanently.",
    "html": "<span class=\"kicker\">Act 4: Phased Implementation &middot; Scoping Evaluation</span>\n  <h2>Delivery Scoping: 8 vs 10 vs 12 Weeks</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\">Addressing leadership inquiry regarding the adequacy of the initial estimate: <b>8 weeks is high risk, 10 weeks is tight on partner runway, and 12 weeks is the derisked recommendation (61 person-weeks)</b>.</p>\n  <div class=\"body scroll\">\n    \n    <div class=\"cols3\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.2em\">\n      \n      <!-- Scenario 1 -->\n      <div class=\"card gap\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:.3em\">\n          <span class=\"pill gap\">SCENARIO 1</span>\n          <span class=\"pill p0\">\ud83d\udd34 HIGH RISK</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:.2em\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>8-Week Sprint</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:.82em\"><b>Minimum Viable Build.</b> Synthetic-only test dry run (no historical replay); async handover; partner excluded.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:.4em;font-size:.8em\"><b>Effort:</b> FDE 8 PW &middot; Zip 12 PW &middot; Partner 0 PW (20 PW Total)</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:.3em;font-size:.78em;color:var(--gap-t)\"><em>Requires VPC ready Day 0. High risk partner cannot operate factory unassisted.</em></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Scenario 2 -->\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:.3em\">\n          <span class=\"pill p1\">SCENARIO 2</span>\n          <span class=\"pill int\">\ud83d\udfe1 PRAGMATIC</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:.2em\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>10-Week Balanced MVP</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:.82em\"><b>Functional Build + Sample Replay.</b> 1-month historical replay (1,000 loans); 2-week compressed pairing.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:.4em;font-size:.8em\"><b>Effort:</b> FDE 10 PW &middot; Zip 18 PW &middot; Partner 4 PW (32 PW Total)</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:.3em;font-size:.78em;color:var(--muted)\"><em>Solid technical proof, but tight on partner operational runway before FDE departs.</em></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Scenario 3 -->\n      <div class=\"card good\" style=\"border-left-color:var(--zip-lime);border-width:2px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:.3em\">\n          <span class=\"pill gcp\" style=\"background:#182800;color:var(--zip-lime);border-color:var(--zip-lime)\">SCENARIO 3 \u00b7 RECOMMENDED</span>\n          <span class=\"pill good\">\ud83d\udfe2 DERISKED</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:.2em\"><span class=\"num\">3</span>12-Week Handover</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:.82em\"><b>Full Build + Financial Proof + 4-Week Partner Co-Delivery.</b> Full 3-year historical loan replay (50,000 loans); $0.00 zero drift.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:.4em;font-size:.8em\"><b>Effort:</b> FDE 12 PW &middot; Zip 28 PW &middot; Partner 16 PW (56\u201361 PW Total)</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:.3em;font-size:.78em;color:var(--gcp-t)\"><em>Guarantees enduring Zip capability and operational independence.</em></p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"callout lime\">\n      <b>Commercial Alignment:</b> 12 weeks concludes on <b>December 31, 2026</b>, coinciding precisely with Zip's Azure early commit retirement date, ensuring all net-new LMS development lands natively on GCP.\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"openExplorerSection('planning')\" style=\"font-size:.82em;padding:.4em .8em\">\n      \ud83d\udcca View Full WBS Capacity Model in Explorer &rarr;\n    </button>\n  </div>"
