    "html": "<span class=\"kicker\">Act 4: Phased Implementation &middot; Execution Schedule</span>\n  <h2>12-Week Implementation Schedule &amp; Handover Pack</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\">A synchronized, week-by-week work breakdown structure spanning October 1 to December 31, 2026, delivering an enterprise-certified software factory.</p>\n  <div class=\"body scroll\">\n    \n    <table style=\"font-size:.78em;margin-bottom:1em\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Week</th><th>Track A: Platform Substrate</th><th>Track B: SDLC &amp; Personas</th><th>Track C: Repayments Pilot &amp; Replay</th><th>Gate</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td><b>W1\u2013W2</b></td><td>Terraform VPC, GKE Enterprise, Cloud SQL</td><td>Artifacts A\u2013F JSON Schema contracts</td><td>Snowflake historical data extraction setup</td><td><span class=\"pill int\">M1 (W2)</span></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><b>W3\u2013W4</b></td><td>Temporal engine, Cloud Run sandboxes</td><td>Vertex AI Gateway, Vertex AI Multi-Model Gateway routing</td><td>Amortization formulas &amp; Reg Z disclosure rules</td><td>\u2014</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><b>W5\u2013W6</b></td><td>Node.js 22 MCP Hub, &lt;750ms kill switch</td><td>10 MVP Personas, zero-code TDD runner</td><td>Repayments Iteration 1 codegen &amp; test run</td><td><span class=\"pill int\">M2 (W5)</span></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><b>W7\u2013W8</b></td><td>GKE Service Mesh, Istio side-effect proxy</td><td>Red Team adversarial challenge personas</td><td>50k historical loans replay ($0.00 zero drift)</td><td><span class=\"pill led\">M3 (W8)</span></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><b>W9\u2013W10</b></td><td>Pub/Sub dual ingestion pipeline from Azure</td><td>Zip/Quantium engineer pairing &amp; dry run</td><td>Repayments Iteration 2: Edge cases &amp; fees</td><td>\u2014</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><b>W11\u2013W12</b></td><td>Production hardening, CIS GKE audit</td><td>Runbooks, ADRs, and Operator Certification</td><td>Unassisted dry run: 0 FDE touches; GA sign-off</td><td><span class=\"pill good\">M4 (W12)</span></td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <div class=\"callout good\">\n      <b>Certified Factory Handover Pack:</b> 8 formal deliverables (ADRs, Terraform IaC, Specification templates, 10 Persona evals, Isolated TDD runner, Runbooks, Historical Replay Pipeline, Operator Certification) signed off before FDE departure.\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"openExplorerSection('planning')\" style=\"font-size:.82em;padding:.4em .8em\">\n      \ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f View Full 12-Week Schedule in Explorer &rarr;\n    </button>\n  </div>"
