    "html": "<span class=\"kicker\">Executive Read-Back &middot; Transformation Summary</span>\n  <h2>The Compounding Autonomous Software Factory</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\">Project Catalyst replaces manual software development with a mathematically verifiable, self-improving manufacturing asset on Google Cloud Platform.</p>\n  <div class=\"body scroll\">\n    \n    <div class=\"cols3\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.2em\">\n      \n      <div class=\"card good\">\n        <h3>1. Velocity with Certainty</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:.83em\">Feature cycles drop from multi-month waterfall sprints to hours of autonomous generation bounded by rigid mathematical and regulatory quality gates.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card good\">\n        <h3>2. Bank-Grade Compliance</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:.83em\">Every code change links to an immutable signed evidence pack with specification diffs, test logs, and regulator-ready verification hashes for OCC/CFPB examiners.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card good\">\n        <h3>3. Sovereign Capability</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:.83em\">The 12-week sequential handover guarantees Zip and Quantium own and operate the factory in perpetuity, eliminating vendor lock-in.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"background:#1B0436;border:2px solid var(--zip-lime);padding:1.2rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem\">\n        <div>\n          <h3 style=\"color:#FFF;font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Explore the Complete Architecture Suite</h3>\n          <p style=\"color:#D8CCE8;font-size:.84rem;margin-top:.2rem\">Switch to the dynamic explorer, view the original whiteboard scans, or inspect the 3 delivery scenarios.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"setAppMode('explorer')\" style=\"font-weight:800\">\n            \u26a1 Open Factory Explorer Suite\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"openExplorerSection('planning')\" style=\"background:#24044B;border-color:var(--zip-lime);color:var(--zip-lime)\">\n            \ud83d\udcca Scoping &amp; 3 Scenarios\n          </button>\n          <a href=\"archived-readback-deck.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#1C0438;border-color:#AA8FFF;color:#D8B4FE;text-decoration:none\">\n            \ud83d\udce6 View Archived 33-Slide Deck \u2197\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>"
